title: Server-Side Template Injection
id: 99560a6d-4c2a-4d05-8bf9-c45cc29e61a0
status: experimental
description: Detects server-side template injection probes in HTTP parameters, such as template evaluation expressions (${7*7}, {{7*7}}, #{}, and Freemarker/Velocity/Jinja constructs) used to achieve code execution.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1190/
logsource:
  category: webserver
detection:
  selection:
    cs-uri-query|contains:
      - '${7*7}'
      - '{{7*7}}'
      - '#{7*7}'
      - 'freemarker'
      - '__class__.__mro__'
      - 'T(java.lang.Runtime)'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - cs-uri-query
  - cs-uri-stem
  - c-ip
falsepositives:
  - Applications using templating syntax in input
level: high
tags:
  - attack.initial_access
  - attack.t1190
